The '3 pre-existing flight-model failures' were three defects wearing
one label; all three are root-caused and closed. Full suite 2,435/2,435.

- world_json.cpp: restore the dropped vcd->max_speed value (the shipped
  korea.world.json was invalid JSON — 8,016 dangling keys crashed every
  airbase-derived E2E in the world loader). Strict-JSON regression test
  added. Committed data repaired (dangling keys removed); manifest
  hashes recomputed, 6 never-committed entries dropped.
- landing_module: STAB-E47 damped localizer (cross-course velocity
  feedback), E48 past-the-fix capture for start_in_approach (armed only
  at the handoff), E49/E57-E62 flare arrest budget + symmetric sink
  floor + localizer chase, E51/E52 intercept cut + establish floor,
  E54 wire the dead beam-tolerance knob, E55 settle = equilibrium with
  the commanded path, E64 arrestable-sink flare gate, E65 VS authority.
- air_steering: E53 window/integral split (scoped to the landing tune —
  the nav-cruise pole goldens pinned the coupled clamp) + E56 Hanus AW.
- simulation: taxi-in terminates at the aircraft's own parking spot.
- tests: the pattern variant owns its approach mode; the walk fixture
  moves out with the establish floor.
